// REJECTS: Field 'content' is required
//
// The ###Text section has three keywords and one required field. `content` is mandatory;
// `type` is not -- neg-text-* has no companion for a missing type because legend-engine
// ACCEPTS a Text element with only content, which is a finding rather than a fixture.
//
// So the asymmetry is the thing being pinned. A rewrite that treats the two fields the
// same way -- both required, or both optional -- is wrong in one direction or the other,
// and a section this small is exactly where "obviously they behave alike" goes unchecked.
###Text
Text fixture::neg::NoContent
{
   type: 'plainText';
}
